===A2_S4_D4===
Chione: Listening to Oren’s stories really does take you back, huh? #portrait:ChioneLaugh
Chione: It feels like only yesterday when we’d hide out in the tents with a lamp… and get scolded by Silas. #portrait:ChioneLaugh 
Amaya: Fires dim the brightness of the stars, after all. #portrait:AmayaTalk
Amaya: But I must admit; he’s really grown into his job. I’m sure he’ll barge into Silas’ home tomorrow, demanding to read the scripture Noelle and Amelia found. #portrait:AmayaTalk
Amaya: You can’t make a good story without prior knowledge, after all. #portrait:AmayaTalk
Narrator: Amaya trails off, a slight scrunch to her brow.
Chione: …You don’t have to worry about the newcomers bringing trouble. #portrait:ChioneHm
Chione: Our island is more than capable of defending itself, no? #portrait:ChioneLaugh
Amaya: You’re right. My gut tells me they’re genuine. #portrait:AmayaThink
Amaya: It’s just… if Noelle really does come from the same island as Noah… #portrait:AmayaThink
Amaya: Let’s just hope history doesn’t repeat itself. #portrait:AmayaThink
